## Egnyte AI
- AI Overview (https://www.egnyte.com/ai)  - Egnyte's main AI hub, covering the full suite of AI capabilities: AI Assistant, AI Agents & Marketplace, Workflow Automation, AI Safeguards, AI Control Center, Context Studio, Extractors & Auto-Classification, and MCP Server. Introduces the Egnyte Context Layer, which connects content with the people, projects, permissions, metadata, and business systems around it to give AI accurate business context, enabling faster response times, more accurate answers, and lower AI costs across AEC, Financial Services, Life Sciences, and Media & Entertainment.
All AI capabilities are grounded in the **Context Layer** (https://www.egnyte.com/ai/context-layer) - a continuously updated knowledge graph built from four interconnected graphs:
- **Content Graph**: captures, indexes, and classifies files by type, topic, metadata, and industry-specific schema
- **Activity Graph**: maps core business activities like projects, clients, deals, and claims
- **User Graph**: incorporates role, activity, permissions, preferences, and memory to build user-specific context
- **Organization Graph**: incorporates business terminology, taxonomy, policies, structure, and relevant external context

Because AI works from enriched organizational context, not raw files or
public training data alone, the Context Layer delivers measurable outcomes:
- 94% more accurate AI answers
- 50% lower AI costs (reduced token consumption)
- 17% fewer tool calls
- 2x increase in AI adoption

