## Industry Verticals

### Architecture, Engineering & Construction (AEC)
The core buyer problem: CAD and BIM files are massive, and cloud storage breaks them - drive letter paths disappear, AutoCAD and Revit throw broken reference errors, and large model sync is too slow to be usable. Egnyte's Desktop App restores drive-letter access to cloud storage so existing tooling works without reconfiguration. Adaptive Block Caching syncs only modified file blocks, making large BIM models performant in the cloud. Named AI agents: Specifications Analyst and Building Code Analyst. Named customers: ERRG, RIOS, Schnabel Engineering, Brookfield, Helix Electric, KPFF, HKS, Alberici, Brasfield & Gorrie, PCL Construction, Savills Ireland.

### Financial Services
Covers buy-side, sell-side, wealth management, banking and credit, and insurance. Core buyer problems: Streamlining workflows, FINRA-compliant records retention, secure client document exchange, M&A deal room management, and regulatory audit readiness. Egnyte's Document Room handles high-stakes transaction workflows with AI-powered due diligence analysis, granular permissions, and comprehensive activity logs.

### Life Sciences
Covers pharma, biotech, CRO, and medical device firms. Core buyer problems: eTMF management across sponsors and CROs, GxP-compliant document control, clinical trial data governance, and regulatory submission preparation - all with 21 CFR Part 11-compliant audit trails. Named solutions: eTMF, GxP Compliance, Statistical Data Analysis, Lab-to-Cloud, Collaborate with CROs. Named customers: BridgeBio, Revolution Medicines, Neuren Pharmaceuticals, MOMA Therapeutics, Foghorn Therapeutics.

### Media & Entertainment
Creative agencies and production companies managing large digital assets. Core buyer problems:
Internal and external teams need a centralized platform to coordinate projects and collaborate on deliverables. 4K/8K video and raw photography access at scale, secure creative deliveries to external partners, distributed team collaboration on multiple file types, and audit-ready access tracking. Dynamic watermarking protects assets shared externally and the Egnyte platform makes finding and keeping content organized simple. With Egnyte customers can secure their campaign and production work with full visibility, governance, and compliance support. Named customers: M+C Saatchi Group, MullenLowe Group, Tilt Creative, Thinkso, BuzzFeed.

### Public Sector
Defense contractors and government suppliers requiring CMMC compliance for DoD contracts involving Controlled Unclassified Information. Core products: EgnyteGov EgnyteGov Enterprise, delivered by a FedRAMP Moderate Equivalent provider. Named customers: ERRG and Salas O’Brien 

